        "subject": "LU-10026 tests: compression component via --component-add",
        "message": "LU-10026 tests: compression component via --component-add\n\nAdd sanity-compr test_1a: create a file with a plain first component,\nappend a compressed component with \"lfs setstripe --component-add\n-Z gzip\" and verify the added component carries the compression\ntype. This covers the compression branch of the component-add path\nin lod_declare_layout_add().\n\nThe lod fix this test was written for is already on master as\ncommit 90c093b7850 (\"LU-17468 lod: component add missed pattern\ninfo\"); only the test part is new here.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nSigned-off-by: Bobi Jam <bobijam@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nWas-Change-Id: I7ad746a550f1afea54a6f5b68823a79a85a44082\nChange-Id: I0624bf3f5f9c965f826e72656a8cd8198c5624fd\n"
      },
